{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54569","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 三十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"败军气，千万似人头。\n更有（京本作「似」）偃鱼零落树，如灰（京本作「又如」）瓦砾覆城楼，其下血交流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}